WEBVTT

00:08:29.172 --> 00:08:31.574
And so some anxiety is good.

00:08:31.608 --> 00:08:34.177
It's sort of like
the sweet spot of anxiety.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:39.516
And then if you keep going, it can become
debilitating and erode performance.

00:08:39.549 --> 00:08:45.455
So it's the back-and-forth
between some is good, too much is bad,

00:08:45.488 --> 00:08:47.557
that we need to be thinking about,

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.093
both as ourselves as individuals

00:08:50.126 --> 00:08:52.829
and also when we're
part of organizations.

00:08:52.862 --> 00:08:55.031
CSB: We have a new question
from the audience.

00:08:55.065 --> 00:08:56.599
Let's bring that one up, please.

00:08:56.633 --> 00:08:57.801
Thank you.

00:08:57.801 --> 00:09:00.470
OK, Kristin Sánchez Salas
from LinkedIn says,